    "excerpt": "Here are some of the best coffee brands you can order online right now, depending on what type of coffee drinker you are:\n\n### 1. Best Overall & Freshness: **[Trade Coffee](https://www.drinktrade.com)**\nInstead of a single roaster, Trade connects you with over 55 of the nation’s top independent roasters (like Verve, Sightglass, and Onyx). \n* **Why buy:** You take a short quiz about your taste preferences and brew method, and they ship bags roasted-to-order directly from the roaster. It is the best way to discover high-quality coffee tailored specifically to you.\n\n### 2. Best Light Roast & Spec"
